PHAT HIEN (Khoi bao cao, da xac nhan bang git log/diff that tren GitHub):
ui/js/renderer.js bi ghi de lui ve ban A20-era o commit "Auto-sync
21/08/2026 9:07:49" (8653c5c), mat toan bo:
1. Patch "Listening..." (Key/BPM/MOD hien trang thai cho khi im lang,
   thay vi giu gia tri cu cua bai truoc).
2. Fix bug "quay lai G# Minor" khi bam AUTO DETECT truoc khi AI kip do
   xong lan dau (keySource.ai.hasResult flag).
Nguyen nhan ky thuat: tat ca commit deu la "Auto-sync" dung ten Khoi (script
tu dong dong bo folder local -> GitHub, khong phan biet Claude A/B) - nhieu
kha nang 1 phien lam viec khac (Claude B) thao tac tren ban local CHUA keo
patch moi nhat cua Claude A ve, roi auto-sync day nguyen trang thai do len,
ghi de mat cong viec da co.

KHONG dung gi khac ngoai renderer.js. KHONG co cai cach kien truc
(khong co gang khoi phuc lai audioEngine.js rieng cua B13 - file van con
tren dia nhung da mo coi (index.html khong con load, renderer.js khong con
goi window.AudioEngine) - la 1 quyet dinh lon hon, de Khoi tu quyet dinh
co muon quay lai kien truc do hay khong, khong tu y lam trong task nay).

KHOI PHUC (renderer.js, dung nhu noi dung 2 patch da mat):
1. Section 2 (INITIAL DATA): "G# Minor"/"128"/"02:15" -> "Listening..."/
   "--"/"--:--", ca modStatus/modTimeline (ghi de bang JS, khong sua HTML).
2. Muc 12B moi: silence-detector nhe, doc lai vuPercent tu
   BPMEngine.onLevel() co san (khong tao engine moi), im lang >=1500ms ->
   Key/BPM/MOD chuyen "Listening...". Ton trong Manual Override/Song
   Database (khong de len).
3. keySource.ai.hasResult=false luc khoi tao, chi bat true khi
   KeyEngine.detectOnce() co ket qua THAT. triggerAiKeyDetect() CHI ap
   dung/gui xuong Plugin khi hasResult=true - khong con gui nham gia tri
   placeholder "G# Minor" khi bam AUTO DETECT qua som.
4. refreshKeySourceDisplay(): dong "AI Detect: ..." cung khong con lo gia
   tri gia.
5. loadData(): khong con phuc hoi data.currentKey cu vao hien thi/
   originalKey luc mo lai app.
6. Bo goi updateNextModTime() (doc mang modTimeline gia con sot) va dong
   demo updateModInfo("02:15","G# Minor","C# Minor",5) chay o moi lan mo
   app.

VERIFIED (jsdom tren index.html that): trang thai dau "Listening..." dung;
Clap van phat dung Vo-Tay.MP3 (kien truc SoundEffectEngine cu hien tai van
hoat dong binh thuong, khong dung gi); bam AUTO DETECT som -> van
"Listening...", KHONG con quay lai "G# Minor"; im lang >1.5s -> BPM/Key
chuyen "Listening...".

Regression: 0 NEW FAIL that (28 test suite, chi 2 fail la self-check
"khong sua file cu" cua AutoSongCollector/NowPlayingResolver - bat buoc
FAIL vi task nay dung la sua renderer.js). MarginLogger.verify.js flaky
(dung setTimeout that ~15s that trong test) - da chay lai 3 lan lien tiep
deu PASS, xac nhan khong phai regression that.

Khong dung keyEngine.js (A25 van nguyen, khong bi anh huong boi lan
rollback nay), khong dung modEngine.js, ui/index.html, MIDI, BPM engine
that, ManualState, ManualPriorityGuard, PluginController.
